---
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/urls';
---
<footer class="site-footer" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <a class="wordmark" href={withBase('/')}><span class="brand-mark">L</span><span>LearningHub</span></a>
    <p>以 Markdown 累積、整理並分享學習成果。</p>
    <div class="footer-links"><a href={withBase('/about/')}>關於與政策</a><a href={withBase('/rss.xml')}>RSS</a>{siteConfig.repositoryUrl && <a href={siteConfig.repositoryUrl}>GitHub</a>}</div>
    <small>程式碼與文章授權待作者確認。本站閱讀偏好僅保存在你的瀏覽器。</small>
  </div>
</footer>
